{"page":222,"width":1802,"height":2437,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"7.3 이중 연결 리스트","words":[{"text":"7.3","x":363,"y":197,"width":61,"height":46},{"text":"이중","x":440,"y":195,"width":90,"height":50},{"text":"연결","x":546,"y":194,"width":89,"height":51},{"text":"리스트","x":655,"y":196,"width":135,"height":50}]},{"text":"단순 연결 리스트에서 어떤 깐1뜨에서 후속 노드를 찾기는 쉽지만. 선행 노드를 찾으려면 구조상","words":[{"text":"단순","x":363,"y":334,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"연결","x":436,"y":334,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"리스트에서","x":507,"y":334,"width":139,"height":33},{"text":"어떤","x":662,"y":335,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"깐1뜨에서","x":729,"y":336,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"후속","x":857,"y":336,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"노드를","x":927,"y":338,"width":88,"height":30},{"text":"찾기는","x":1027,"y":336,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"쉽지만.","x":1128,"y":335,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"선행","x":1242,"y":336,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"노드를","x":1315,"y":337,"width":95,"height":31},{"text":"찾으려면","x":1423,"y":336,"width":126,"height":32},{"text":"구조상","x":1562,"y":338,"width":92,"height":32}]},{"text":"이주 어렵다. 원형 연결 리스트라고 하더리도 거의 전체 노드를 거쳐서 돌아 외야 한다. 따라서","words":[{"text":"이주","x":363,"y":388,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"어렵다.","x":435,"y":388,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"원형","x":545,"y":388,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"연결","x":616,"y":388,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"리스트라고","x":686,"y":388,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"하더리도","x":843,"y":389,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"거의","x":972,"y":389,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"전체","x":1043,"y":388,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"노드를","x":1111,"y":391,"width":92,"height":30},{"text":"거쳐서","x":1217,"y":390,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"돌아","x":1321,"y":390,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"외야","x":1397,"y":390,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"한다.","x":1474,"y":390,"width":71,"height":32},{"text":"따라서","x":1564,"y":389,"width":85,"height":35}]},{"text":"공공 프로그램에서 특정 올드에서 양빙장으로 자유롭게 움직일 필요가 있다면 단순 연결 리스트","words":[{"text":"공공","x":361,"y":442,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"프로그램에서","x":432,"y":441,"width":172,"height":32},{"text":"특정","x":618,"y":442,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"올드에서","x":686,"y":442,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"양빙장으로","x":814,"y":442,"width":145,"height":32},{"text":"자유롭게","x":971,"y":442,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"움직일","x":1098,"y":442,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"필요가","x":1203,"y":443,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"있다면","x":1308,"y":445,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"단순","x":1413,"y":444,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"연결","x":1490,"y":444,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"리스트","x":1566,"y":444,"width":87,"height":32}]},{"text":"구조는 부적합하다. 이중 연결 리스트는 이러한 문제점을 해결하기 위하여 만들어진 자료구조","words":[{"text":"구조는","x":361,"y":498,"width":90,"height":30},{"text":"부적합하다.","x":464,"y":495,"width":151,"height":33},{"text":"이중","x":635,"y":495,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"연결","x":707,"y":495,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"리스트는","x":779,"y":496,"width":115,"height":31},{"text":"이러한","x":908,"y":496,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"문제점을","x":1008,"y":496,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"해결하기","x":1142,"y":497,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"위하여","x":1281,"y":499,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"만들어진","x":1390,"y":498,"width":126,"height":32},{"text":"자료구조","x":1533,"y":499,"width":120,"height":33}]},{"text":"이다.","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":363,"y":549,"width":64,"height":32}]},{"text":"나의 선행","words":[{"text":"나의","x":918,"y":684,"width":42,"height":23},{"text":"선행","x":971,"y":684,"width":43,"height":24}]},{"text":"노드는?","words":[{"text":"노드는?","x":925,"y":722,"width":82,"height":23}]},{"text":"head -","words":[{"text":"head","x":359,"y":876,"width":52,"height":20},{"text":"-","x":422,"y":882,"width":103,"height":13}]},{"text":"[그림 7-5] 단순 연결 리스트에서의 선행 노드를 찾는 것은 어렵다","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":359,"y":960,"width":56,"height":29},{"text":"7-5]","x":426,"y":960,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"단순","x":497,"y":963,"width":46,"height":24},{"text":"연결","x":552,"y":963,"width":44,"height":24},{"text":"리스트에서의","x":607,"y":963,"width":136,"height":26},{"text":"선행","x":753,"y":964,"width":45,"height":26},{"text":"노드를","x":807,"y":965,"width":70,"height":24},{"text":"찾는","x":886,"y":964,"width":46,"height":25},{"text":"것은","x":942,"y":965,"width":44,"height":24},{"text":"어렵다","x":997,"y":965,"width":69,"height":25}]},{"text":"NULL","words":[{"text":"NULL","x":1421,"y":885,"width":56,"height":19}]},{"text":"이중 연결 리스트는 하나의 노드가 선행 노드와 후속 노드에 대한 두 개의 링크를 가지는 리스","words":[{"text":"이중","x":392,"y":1071,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"연결","x":462,"y":1070,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"리스트는","x":531,"y":1070,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"하나의","x":657,"y":1072,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"노드가","x":754,"y":1072,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"선행","x":854,"y":1072,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"노드와","x":922,"y":1072,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"후속","x":1021,"y":1073,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"노드에","x":1092,"y":1074,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"대한","x":1196,"y":1074,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"두","x":1267,"y":1076,"width":32,"height":30},{"text":"개의","x":1311,"y":1075,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"링크를","x":1385,"y":1074,"width":94,"height":32},{"text":"가지는","x":1491,"y":1073,"width":93,"height":31},{"text":"리스","x":1597,"y":1073,"width":57,"height":31}]},{"text":"트이다. 링크가 양방향이므로 양방향으로 검색이 기능해진다. 단점으로는 공간을 많이 차지하고","words":[{"text":"트이다.","x":356,"y":1125,"width":96,"height":31},{"text":"링크가","x":469,"y":1125,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"양방향이므로","x":567,"y":1126,"width":174,"height":32},{"text":"양방향으로","x":753,"y":1127,"width":147,"height":31},{"text":"검색이","x":912,"y":1127,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"기능해진다.","x":1012,"y":1127,"width":155,"height":32},{"text":"단점으로는","x":1184,"y":1128,"width":156,"height":31},{"text":"공간을","x":1350,"y":1128,"width":96,"height":32},{"text":"많이","x":1458,"y":1127,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"차지하고","x":1532,"y":1126,"width":122,"height":32}]},{"text":"코드가 복잡해진다는 것이다. 그러나 그럼에도 ₩하고 여러 가지 장점이 많기 때문에 널리 쓰","words":[{"text":"코드가","x":355,"y":1179,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"복잡해진다는","x":455,"y":1179,"width":178,"height":32},{"text":"것이다.","x":646,"y":1181,"width":92,"height":31},{"text":"그러나","x":753,"y":1181,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"그럼에도","x":853,"y":1181,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"₩하고","x":983,"y":1181,"width":120,"height":31},{"text":"여러","x":1117,"y":1181,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"가지","x":1190,"y":1182,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"장점이","x":1262,"y":1182,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"많기","x":1369,"y":1181,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"때문에","x":1445,"y":1180,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"널리","x":1553,"y":1179,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"쓰","x":1625,"y":1184,"width":29,"height":24}]},{"text":"인다.","words":[{"text":"인다.","x":358,"y":1233,"width":63,"height":31}]},{"text":"헤드노드","words":[{"text":"헤드노드","x":354,"y":1342,"width":92,"height":23}]},{"text":"[그림 7-6] 이중 연결 리스트","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":357,"y":1601,"width":56,"height":29},{"text":"7-6]","x":424,"y":1600,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"이중","x":495,"y":1603,"width":44,"height":25},{"text":"연결","x":549,"y":1602,"width":43,"height":25},{"text":"리스트","x":604,"y":1603,"width":67,"height":24}]},{"text":"실제 응용에서는 [그림 7제처럼 이중 연결 리스트와 원형 연결 리스트를 혼합한 형태가 많이","words":[{"text":"실제","x":392,"y":1711,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"응용에서는","x":459,"y":1711,"width":146,"height":32},{"text":"[그림","x":616,"y":1712,"width":58,"height":29},{"text":"7제처럼","x":687,"y":1710,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"이중","x":815,"y":1710,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"연결","x":888,"y":1710,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"리스트와","x":960,"y":1710,"width":120,"height":32},{"text":"원형","x":1092,"y":1710,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"연결","x":1168,"y":1710,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"리스트를","x":1242,"y":1710,"width":124,"height":31},{"text":"혼합한","x":1377,"y":1709,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"형태가","x":1487,"y":1708,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"많이","x":1593,"y":1708,"width":54,"height":33}]},{"text":"시용된다. 또 헤드 노드(head node)라는 특별한 노드를 추가하는 경우가 많다. 헤드 포인터외는","words":[{"text":"시용된다.","x":358,"y":1766,"width":121,"height":31},{"text":"또","x":494,"y":1769,"width":29,"height":22},{"text":"헤드","x":534,"y":1766,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"노드(head","x":601,"y":1765,"width":134,"height":32},{"text":"node)라는","x":747,"y":1765,"width":137,"height":33},{"text":"특별한","x":894,"y":1765,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"노드를","x":994,"y":1766,"width":93,"height":29},{"text":"추가하는","x":1096,"y":1765,"width":125,"height":32},{"text":"경우가","x":1234,"y":1764,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"많다.","x":1337,"y":1763,"width":69,"height":32},{"text":"헤드","x":1424,"y":1764,"width":63,"height":31},{"text":"포인터외는","x":1497,"y":1762,"width":154,"height":32}]},{"text":"구별하여야 한다. 헤드 포인터는 리스트의 첫 번째 노드를 가리카는 포인터이고, 헤드 노드는 데","words":[{"text":"구별하여야","x":358,"y":1819,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":512,"y":1820,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"헤드","x":591,"y":1819,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"포인터는","x":658,"y":1820,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"리스트의","x":787,"y":1819,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"첫","x":916,"y":1819,"width":26,"height":32},{"text":"번째","x":957,"y":1819,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"노드를","x":1025,"y":1820,"width":93,"height":30},{"text":"가리카는","x":1129,"y":1819,"width":123,"height":32},{"text":"포인터이고,","x":1262,"y":1818,"width":165,"height":33},{"text":"헤드","x":1443,"y":1817,"width":63,"height":31},{"text":"노드는","x":1517,"y":1818,"width":94,"height":29},{"text":"데","x":1623,"y":1817,"width":24,"height":32}]},{"text":"이터를 가지고 있지 않는 특별한 노드를 추가하는 것이다. 해드 노드가 존재하게 되면 삽입, 삭","words":[{"text":"이터를","x":360,"y":1873,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"가지고","x":457,"y":1873,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"있지","x":556,"y":1874,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"않는","x":623,"y":1874,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"특별한","x":691,"y":1874,"width":89,"height":30},{"text":"노드를","x":790,"y":1875,"width":89,"height":29},{"text":"추가하는","x":890,"y":1873,"width":121,"height":31},{"text":"것이다.","x":1025,"y":1873,"width":96,"height":31},{"text":"해드","x":1139,"y":1873,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"노드가","x":1212,"y":1872,"width":95,"height":32},{"text":"존재하게","x":1319,"y":1872,"width":123,"height":32},{"text":"되면","x":1460,"y":1872,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"삽입,","x":1534,"y":1871,"width":70,"height":33},{"text":"삭","x":1621,"y":1872,"width":29,"height":32}]},{"text":"제 알고리즘이 간편해진다. 헤드 노드의 데이터 필드는 아무런 정보工 담고 있지 않다. 다만 삽","words":[{"text":"제","x":361,"y":1926,"width":25,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘이","x":401,"y":1926,"width":137,"height":32},{"text":"간편해진다.","x":554,"y":1927,"width":148,"height":31},{"text":"헤드","x":719,"y":1928,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"노드의","x":788,"y":1927,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"데이터","x":890,"y":1926,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"필드는","x":992,"y":1926,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"아무런","x":1095,"y":1927,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"정보工","x":1201,"y":1927,"width":91,"height":31},{"text":"담고","x":1306,"y":1927,"width":62,"height":30},{"text":"있지","x":1384,"y":1926,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"않다.","x":1459,"y":1925,"width":69,"height":32},{"text":"다만","x":1547,"y":1925,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"삽","x":1620,"y":1927,"width":30,"height":31}]},{"text":"입과 삭제 알고리즘을 간편하게 하기 위하여 존재한다.","words":[{"text":"입과","x":364,"y":1979,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"삭제","x":427,"y":1980,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":494,"y":1980,"width":141,"height":31},{"text":"간편하게","x":645,"y":1980,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"하기","x":770,"y":1980,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"위하여","x":838,"y":1980,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"존재한다.","x":936,"y":1980,"width":126,"height":32}]},{"text":"이중 연결 리스트를 구현해보자. 먼저 노드의 구조를 정의해야 할 것이다. 이중 연결 리스트에","words":[{"text":"이중","x":396,"y":2032,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"연결","x":462,"y":2032,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"리스트를","x":528,"y":2032,"width":112,"height